{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-webdav-server#card-zh","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-webdav-server","commit":"c5c524e0260988b247b036ce39242001355566c8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-webdav-server 是面向 DSH 网页端的 WebDAV 文件共享插件。它在宿主中启动独立的 WebDAV 服务，把一个固定共享目录提供给 Windows、macOS、Linux 等系统挂载为网络磁盘。用户可配置共享路径、监听地址和端口，选择独立访问令牌或复用 user-management 账号认证，也可切换只读和软链接选项；设置页展示连接地址、凭据与多平台挂载指南。适合需要从其他设备访问 DSH 主机文件目录的场景。默认无需外部 API 或额外账号；首次启动会生成并保存访问令牌。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:89-95","src/index.js:246-305","src/server.js:27-48","src/server.js:169-220","client/index.js:323-404"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-webdav-server#card-en","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-webdav-server","commit":"c5c524e0260988b247b036ce39242001355566c8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-webdav-server serves a DSH host folder through an independent WebDAV service that devices can mount as a network drive. Configure the folder, address, port, authentication and read-only mode in its settings page. A token is generated at startup.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:89-95","src/index.js:246-305","src/server.js:27-48","src/server.js:169-220","client/index.js:323-404"]}
