{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-webdav-server#feature-1","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-webdav-server","commit":"c5c524e0260988b247b036ce39242001355566c8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-webdav-server 的功能「WebDAV 目录共享」：通过独立服务共享指定目录，默认目录为 ~/.dsh/dsh-webdav-server/share，供挂载设备访问。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/server.js:54-69","src/server.js:169-220"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-webdav-server#feature-2","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-webdav-server","commit":"c5c524e0260988b247b036ce39242001355566c8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-webdav-server 的功能「认证方式切换」：设置中可选独立令牌或 user-management 账号密码认证；缺少用户库时认证会回退到令牌。首次启动生成令牌，也可在设置页重新生成。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:123-141","src/index.js:181-220","src/index.js:379-383"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-webdav-server#feature-3","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-webdav-server","commit":"c5c524e0260988b247b036ce39242001355566c8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-webdav-server 的功能「只读共享」：开启只读选项后，服务放行 GET、HEAD、OPTIONS 和 PROPFIND 请求，其他方法返回 403，适合只需浏览共享目录的挂载场景。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/server.js:48","src/server.js:209-219","client/index.js:333-336"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-webdav-server#feature-4","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-webdav-server","commit":"c5c524e0260988b247b036ce39242001355566c8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-webdav-server 的功能「可配置挂载服务」：可设置共享根目录、监听地址和端口；配置变化后插件重建独立监听器。设置页还展示局域网地址、访问凭据，并提供多个桌面系统的挂载说明。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:246-305","src/index.js:417-426","client/index.js:323-404"]}
{"unit_id":"weibaohui__dsh-webdav-server#feature-5","repo":"weibaohui/dsh-webdav-server","commit":"c5c524e0260988b247b036ce39242001355566c8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@weibaohui/dsh-webdav-server 的功能「user-management 账号复用」：切换该认证模式后使用现有用户库验证用户名和密码；启用 TOTP 或已禁用的账号无法通过 WebDAV Basic 认证。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:131-140","src/um-auth.js:130-159"]}
